  "properties": {
    "title": "GRID3 NGA - Settlement Extents v4.0",
    "description": "This version supersedes GRID3 NGA - Settlement Extents v3.1 . The following changes were made: Creation of blocks in urban and semi-urban areas; and Removal of falsely detected settlements identified during fieldwork For more information on the methodology and data sources used during the production of these data, click here . Dataset citation Center for Integrated Earth System Information (CIESIN), Columbia University. 2026. GRID3 NGA - Settlement Extents v4.0. New York: GRID3. https://doi.org/10.7916/fr96-f546. Accessed [DAY MONTH YEAR]. Contacts and data queries The authors of this dataset appreciate feedback regarding the data, including suggestions, discovery of errors, difficulties in using the data, and format preferences. For dataset-related questions, please send an email to: info@ciesin.columbia.edu",
